          ],
          "interaction": {
            "kind": "speaking",
            "prompt": [
              {
                "t": "text",
                "v": "Look at the photograph of people in a classroom and talk about it on your own for about one minute."
              }
            ],
            "turns": [
              {
                "id": "t1",
                "text": "Now I’d like you to talk on your own about something. I’m going to give you a photograph and I’d like you to talk about it. Here is your photograph. It shows people in a classroom. Please tell us what you can see in the photograph.",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/pet1/pet1-t4-s-q2-t1.mp3",
                  "seconds": 17.3
                }
              }
            ],
            "maxSeconds": 75,
            "scoring": "judge"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "part": 3,
      "label": "Part 3",
      "instruction": "Talk together with your partner about the situation.",
      "questions": [
        {
          "id": "q3",
          "number": 3,
          "points": 20,
          "skills": [],
          "material": [
            {
              "id": "i2",
              "type": "imageRef",
              "image": "img2"
            }
          ],
          "interaction": {
            "kind": "speaking",
            "prompt": [
              {
                "t": "text",
                "v": "Talk with your partner about the activities a family could do on a long train journey, and decide which would be most fun."
              }
            ],
            "turns": [
              {
                "id": "t1",
                "text": "Now, in this part of the test you’re going to talk about something together for about two minutes. I’m going to describe a situation to you. A family is going on a long journey by train. They want to do something on the journey so they don’t feel bored. Here are some activities they could do on the journey. Talk together about the different activities they could do and say which would be most fun. All right? Now, talk together.",
                "role": "examiner",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/pet1/pet1-t4-s-q3-t1.mp3",
                  "seconds": 30.5
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t2",
                "text": "Shall I start? I think playing chess is a good idea, because the journey is long and it takes time. What do you think?",
                "role": "partner",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/pet1/pet1-t4-s-q3-t2.mp3",
                  "seconds": 8.3
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t3",
                "text": "Yes, and what about listening to music? Everyone can choose their own songs. But they can’t talk to each other then. Do you agree?",
                "role": "partner",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/pet1/pet1-t4-s-q3-t3.mp3",
                  "seconds": 8.5
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t4",
                "text": "I like the idea of taking photos. You can see lots of beautiful places from a train window. Would you enjoy that?",
                "role": "partner",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/pet1/pet1-t4-s-q3-t4.mp3",
                  "seconds": 7.6
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t5",
                "text": "Watching a film on a laptop could be fun too, but the screen is quite small for four people. What’s your opinion?",
                "role": "partner",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/pet1/pet1-t4-s-q3-t5.mp3",
                  "seconds": 6.8
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t6",
                "text": "Playing the guitar and singing looks fun, but maybe the other passengers won’t like the noise. What do you think?",
                "role": "partner",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/pet1/pet1-t4-s-q3-t6.mp3",
                  "seconds": 6.4
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t7",
                "text": "So, which one do you think would be most fun? I think having a picnic, because everyone likes eating together.",
                "role": "partner",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/pet1/pet1-t4-s-q3-t7.mp3",
                  "seconds": 6.8
                }
              }
            ],
            "maxSeconds": 45,
            "scoring": "judge"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
